<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair to schedule Vietnam next year.</title>
<headline>Swissair to schedule Vietnam next year.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair AG said it would begin scheduled service to Vietnam with twice-weekly flights to Ho Chi Minh City, the former Saigon, as of late October 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Ho Chi Minh City is a financial and business centre and we expect both business and leisure travelers,&quot; a Swissair spokesman said.</p>
<p>Swissair said it would fly two days a week between Zurich and Vietnam via Bangkok, raising the number of its weekly services to Bangkok from seven to nine.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
